WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.706
It was a rainy day.

2
00:00:07.707 --> 00:00:13.588
"It's a perfect day for cleaning," Flopsy said.

3
00:00:13.589 --> 00:00:19.351
Mopsy frowned. "Ugh," she said.

4
00:00:19.351 --> 00:00:30.234
"Cleaning is not fun," Cotton-tail said.

5
00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:39.391
Flopsy gave dusters to her sisters.

6
00:00:39.391 --> 00:00:44.611
She got a broom.

7
00:00:44.612 --> 00:00:51.333
The three bunnies began to clean.

8
00:00:51.334 --> 00:00:58.714
Outside, Tommy Brock was looking for a new home.

9
00:00:58.715 --> 00:01:07.675
The badger was wet and cold.

10
00:01:07.676 --> 00:01:12.137
Then he spotted a den.

11
00:01:12.137 --> 00:01:16.473
"That den looks clean and dry," Tommy thought.

12
00:01:16.473 --> 00:01:22.243
"I will move in!"

13
00:01:22.244 --> 00:01:25.707
Flopsy began scrubbing dishes.

14
00:01:25.708 --> 00:01:29.822
Mopsy and Cotton-tail were still dusting.

15
00:01:29.823 --> 00:01:33.324
Then the rain stopped.

16
00:01:33.324 --> 00:01:36.501
The sun came out.

17
00:01:36.501 --> 00:01:39.297
Mopsy looked at Cotton-tail.

18
00:01:39.298 --> 00:01:42.050
Cotton-tail looked at Mopsy.

19
00:01:42.051 --> 00:01:51.887
"Let's go outside!" Mopsy whispered.

20
00:01:51.888 --> 00:02:08.522
The two little rabbits sneaked outside.

21
00:02:08.523 --> 00:02:13.341
They hopped away fast down the lane.

22
00:02:13.342 --> 00:02:17.601
"It's so quiet," Flopsy thought.

23
00:02:17.602 --> 00:02:21.681
She turned around.

24
00:02:21.682 --> 00:02:34.658
"Mopsy?" she called. "Cotton-tail?"

25
00:02:34.659 --> 00:02:41.308
Tommy dragged his things into the den.

26
00:02:41.309 --> 00:02:50.170
"Whew!" he said. "That was hard work.

27
00:02:50.171 --> 00:02:52.855
Now I need some food."

28
00:02:52.856 --> 00:02:59.690
Just then two bunnies hopped by . . .

